it forks the boilerplate

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.570
in Bitbucket, then
it creates a project

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.130
and enabled services, like
Vision API, datastore API,

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.910
the APIs that we commonly use.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:07.698
